# function in rx-calc; it is replicated MINIMALLY below (see e1rm()) citing the
# SKILL.md / telemetry spec as source (weight * (1 + (reps + rir) / 30)).
#
# stdlib only; text output. Exit 0 on success, 1 on bad args / missing files.

