# CH2 DELIVERY LEDGER -- the table rail's missing half.
# set-arm writes the timer/keyboard rail into this same TSV file. The table
# rail wrote NOTHING, so a failed table send left no trace at all. That gap is
# what made the 2026-09-03 06:53 investigation misattribute a `FAILED rc=35`
